2:T6ac,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"LocalBusiness","name":"GreenPoint Maintenance Services - Brooklyn","description":"Office cleaning refers to the professional janitorial maintenance of commercial office environments ranging from single-tenant suites to multi-floor Class A office buildings. Office cleaning encompasses daily operations including trash removal, restroom sanitization, floor care, high-touch surface disinfection, kitchen and breakroom maintenance, lobby presentation, and conference room ready-service. GreenPoint Maintenance Services provides MBE-certified office cleaning in Brooklyn and throughout New York with real-time ATP bioluminescence verification through JaniTrack.","url":"https://greenpointms.com/locations/new-york/brooklyn/office-cleaning/","telephone":"+1-347-332-9348","email":"info@greenpointms.com","areaServed":{"@type":"City","name":"Brooklyn","containedInPlace":{"@type":"State","name":"New York"}},"serviceType":"Commercial Office Buildings","priceRange":"$","hasOfferCatalog":{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Office Cleaning Services","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Customized cleaning checklists per floor"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"After-hours and weekend service options"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Conference room ready-service programs"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Tenant satisfaction and retention programs"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Lobby and reception area presentation"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Kitchen, breakroom, and restroom care"}}]}}3:T1014,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is professional office cleaning?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Professional office cleaning is the recurring janitorial maintenance of commercial office environments. It encompasses daily operations including trash removal, restroom sanitization, floor care (vacuuming and mopping), high-touch surface disinfection, kitchen and breakroom cleaning, lobby presentation, and conference room ready-service. Professional office cleaning differs from residential cleaning in its scale, equipment, product specifications, and the need for consistent quality across large, multi-area environments."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you clean our office without disrupting business hours?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We offer after-hours (evening), overnight, and weekend cleaning schedules that complete all work before your team arrives in the morning. For daytime needs, day porter services handle restroom monitoring, lobby maintenance, spill response, and conference room turnovers without disrupting your team's work. Scheduling is fully customizable to match your office's operating hours and occupancy patterns."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you ensure consistent quality across multiple floors?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Every floor receives a customized cleaning checklist specifying tasks, frequencies, and quality standards. Our JaniTrack system provides timestamped photo verification of completed work across every area. Supervisors conduct periodic quality audits using ISSA appearance level scoring. If quality varies between floors, we identify the root cause (staffing, training, equipment) and correct it — the data tells us exactly where to focus."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you provide restroom and kitchen supplies?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Supply management is included in our service — we monitor paper towel, toilet paper, soap, and hand sanitizer levels, restock during every service visit, and manage vendor relationships for consumable procurement. You never need to worry about empty dispensers or last-minute supply runs. Supply costs can be included in the contract or billed separately at your preference."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does office cleaning include?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our standard office cleaning includes trash removal and recycling, restroom cleaning and sanitization, floor vacuuming and mopping, high-touch surface disinfection (handles, switches, shared equipment), kitchen and breakroom cleaning, lobby and reception maintenance, conference room ready-service, and supply replenishment. Specialty services like floor stripping, carpet extraction, and window cleaning are available on periodic schedules."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does office cleaning cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Standard office cleaning ranges from $0.05-$0.15 per square foot per cleaning visit depending on square footage, cleaning frequency, restroom count, and scope. A typical 10,000 sq ft office cleaned 5 nights per week runs approximately $2,500-$5,000 per month. Multi-floor buildings and buildings with high restroom density or food service areas cost more per square foot. We provide exact pricing after a complimentary facility walkthrough."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between office cleaning and janitorial service?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The terms are often used interchangeably. 'Janitorial service' is the broader category encompassing all recurring commercial cleaning. 'Office cleaning' specifically refers to janitorial service for office environments. The distinction matters when comparing to specialized cleaning types like medical office cleaning (which adds OSHA compliance) or school cleaning (which adds CDC protocols and non-toxic product requirements). Standard office cleaning follows ISSA appearance level standards and OSHA general housekeeping requirements."}}]}6:["stateSlug","new-york","d"]
7:["citySlug","brooklyn","d"]
8:["industrySlug","office-cleaning","d"]
a:T5d4,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"LocalBusiness","name":"GreenPoint Maintenance Services Corp","description":"MBE-certified commercial janitorial and facility maintenance for schools, healthcare, churches, daycare, government buildings, and offices across NY, NJ, CT, PA, and FL.","url":"https://greenpointms.com","telephone":"+1-347-332-9348","email":"info@greenpointms.com","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Bronx","addressRegion":"NY","addressCountry":"US"},"areaServed":[{"@type":"State","name":"New York"},{"@type":"State","name":"New Jersey"},{"@type":"State","name":"Connecticut"},{"@type":"State","name":"Pennsylvania"},{"@type":"State","name":"Florida"}],"priceRange":"$","foundingDate":"2018","numberOfEmployees":{"@type":"QuantitativeValue","minValue":80},"naics":"561720","knowsAbout":["Commercial Janitorial","Disinfection","Floor Care","Day Porter","Facility Maintenance","Post-Construction Cleanup"],"hasCredential":[{"@type":"EducationalOccupationalCredential","credentialCategory":"certification","name":"Minority Business Enterprise (MBE) — NYC & NYS"},{"@type":"EducationalOccupationalCredential","credentialCategory":"certification","name":"MWBE Certified"},{"@type":"EducationalOccupationalCredential","credentialCategory":"registration","name":"SAM.gov Registered Federal Contractor"},{"@type":"EducationalOccupationalCredential","credentialCategory":"certification","name":"NYC Department of Education (DOE) Approved Vendor"}],"sameAs":[]}b:T452,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"GreenPoint Maintenance Services Corp","legalName":"GreenPoint Maintenance Services Corp","url":"https://greenpointms.com","logo":"https://greenpointms.com/favicon.ico","description":"MBE-certified commercial janitorial and facility maintenance serving schools, healthcare, churches, daycare, government buildings, and offices across NY, NJ, CT, PA, and FL.","telephone":"+1-347-332-9348","email":"info@greenpointms.com","foundingDate":"2018","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"1420 Outlook Ave","addressLocality":"Bronx","addressRegion":"NY","postalCode":"10465","addressCountry":"US"},"areaServed":[{"@type":"State","name":"New York"},{"@type":"State","name":"New Jersey"},{"@type":"State","name":"Connecticut"},{"@type":"State","name":"Pennsylvania"},{"@type":"State","name":"Florida"}],"knowsAbout":["Commercial Janitorial","Disinfection & Sanitization","Floor Care","Day Porter Services","Facility Maintenance","Post-Construction Cleanup"],"numberOfEmployees":{"@type":"QuantitativeValue","minValue":80},"naics":"561720"}0:["zD84zgCHYzEIZPbtDt1yS",[[["",{"children":["locations",{"children":[["stateSlug","new-york","d"],{"children":[["citySlug","brooklyn","d"],{"children":[["industrySlug","office-cleaning","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"stateSlug\":\"new-york\",\"citySlug\":\"brooklyn\",\"industrySlug\":\"office-cleaning\"}",{}]}]}]}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["locations",{"children":[["stateSlug","new-york","d"],{"children":[["citySlug","brooklyn","d"],{"children":[["industrySlug","office-cleaning","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://greenpointms.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"New York\",\"item\":\"https://greenpointms.com/locations/new-york/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Brooklyn\",\"item\":\"https://greenpointms.com/locations/new-york/brooklyn/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Office Cleaning\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Office Cleaning in Brooklyn, NY\",\"description\":\"Comprehensive cleaning programs for single-tenant offices to multi-floor commercial properties including conference rooms, reception areas, and shared spaces.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"name\":\"GreenPoint Maintenance Services Corp\",\"telephone\":\"+1-347-332-9348\",\"url\":\"https://greenpointms.com\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Brooklyn\",\"containedInPlace\":{\"@type\":\"State\",\"name\":\"New York\"}},\"serviceType\":\"Commercial Office Buildings\"}"}}],["$","$L4",null,{"title":["Office Cleaning"," Services in ","Brooklyn",", ",["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#2ecc71"},"children":"NY"}]],"subtitle":"Office cleaning refers to the professional janitorial maintenance of commercial office environments ranging from single-tenant suites to multi-floor Class A office buildings. Office cleaning encompasses daily operations including trash removal, restroom sanitization, floor care, high-touch surface disinfection, kitchen and breakroom maintenance, lobby presentation, and conference room ready-service. GreenPoint Maintenance Services provides MBE-certified office cleaning in Brooklyn and throughout New York with real-time ATP bioluminescence verification through JaniTrack.","breadcrumbs":[{"label":"New York","href":"/locations/new-york/"},{"label":"Brooklyn","href":"/locations/new-york/brooklyn/"},{"label":"Office Cleaning"}],"heroIcon":"building","sections":[{"label":"What Is Office Cleaning","heading":"Commercial Office Buildings in Brooklyn, NY","body":"Office cleaning refers to the professional janitorial maintenance of commercial office environments ranging from single-tenant suites to multi-floor Class A office buildings. Office cleaning encompasses daily operations including trash removal, restroom sanitization, floor care, high-touch surface disinfection, kitchen and breakroom maintenance, lobby presentation, and conference room ready-service. Professional office cleaning is the largest segment of the commercial cleaning industry, serving an estimated 6 million commercial office buildings in the United States.\n\nGreenPoint Maintenance Services provides professional office cleaning services throughout Brooklyn and Kings County. As an MBE-certified commercial cleaning company serving New York since 2018, we combine EPA-registered products, electrostatic application technology, and ATP bioluminescence verification to deliver measurable, documented results for every facility we serve.","features":["Customized cleaning checklists per floor","After-hours and weekend service options","Conference room ready-service programs","Tenant satisfaction and retention programs","Lobby and reception area presentation","Kitchen, breakroom, and restroom care"]},{"label":"Why Brooklyn Businesses Need Office Cleaning","heading":"Why Businesses in Brooklyn Need Professional Office Cleaning","body":"Facilities in Brooklyn, NY face increasing pressure to maintain safe, hygienic environments for employees, customers, students, and patients. Professional office cleaning addresses these requirements systematically.","features":["Tenant satisfaction and retention — commercial property surveys consistently rank restroom cleanliness and common area maintenance as the top two factors in tenant satisfaction, directly impacting lease renewals and property NOI","Employee productivity and health — the CDC reports that improved workplace hygiene reduces sick days by 20-30%, while studies show employees in clean work environments report 15% higher productivity and job satisfaction","Professional image and client impressions — lobbies, reception areas, conference rooms, and restrooms form visitors' first impression of your business, directly impacting client confidence and business development outcomes","Asset preservation — commercial floors, carpets, restroom fixtures, and furniture degrade 40-60% faster without proper maintenance, accelerating costly capital replacement cycles","OSHA compliance and liability reduction — employers are required to maintain clean, sanitary workplaces. Documented cleaning programs demonstrate due diligence in the event of health complaints or workplace injury claims"]},{"label":"How It Works","heading":"How Professional Office Cleaning Works","body":"Our office cleaning process follows a systematic, six-step protocol designed to maximize pathogen elimination and provide verifiable documentation of results. Every step is performed by trained, background-checked technicians.","steps":[{"step":"Office and Workstation Cleaning","detail":"Desks, cubicle surfaces, and shared workstation areas are dusted and disinfected. Trash receptacles are emptied and relined. Personal office areas receive vacuuming and floor care. Computer peripherals and phone handsets in common areas are disinfected."},{"step":"Restroom Deep Cleaning","detail":"Full restroom sanitization using hospital-grade disinfectants — toilets, urinals, sinks, mirrors, partitions, dispensers, and floors. Supply levels are verified and replenished. High-touch surfaces (handles, switches, locks) receive targeted disinfection."},{"step":"Kitchen and Breakroom Maintenance","detail":"Countertops, sinks, appliance exteriors, tables, and chairs are cleaned and sanitized. Trash and recycling are emptied. Floors are swept and mopped. Refrigerators receive scheduled cleanouts to prevent odor and health issues."},{"step":"Lobby and Reception Presentation","detail":"Entrance glass, lobby furniture, elevator vestibules, directory boards, and reception counters are cleaned and polished. These areas receive the highest presentation standards because they form every visitor's first impression."},{"step":"Conference Room Ready-Service","detail":"Conference tables are wiped, chairs straightened, whiteboards cleaned, trash removed, and supplies restocked after hours so every room is meeting-ready by morning. Day porter service provides between-meeting turnovers during business hours."},{"step":"Floor Care and Verification","detail":"Carpeted areas are vacuumed using HEPA-filtered equipment. Hard floors are dust-mopped and wet-mopped. All work is documented through JaniTrack with timestamped photos. Periodic ATP testing verifies high-touch surface cleanliness."}]},{"label":"Industries in Brooklyn","heading":"Industries That Require Office Cleaning in Brooklyn","body":"We deliver specialized office cleaning services across every commercial and institutional facility type in Brooklyn and throughout Kings County. Each industry receives protocols tailored to its specific compliance requirements, risk profile, and operational constraints.","industriesServed":[{"name":"Class A Multi-Tenant Office Buildings","detail":"Full-building janitorial programs for premium office properties including lobby presentation, tenant-floor cleaning, common area maintenance, and building management coordination for 50,000+ sq ft properties."},{"name":"Single-Tenant Corporate Offices","detail":"Customized cleaning programs for corporate headquarters and single-tenant buildings with specific brand standards, executive suite requirements, and specialized areas like training rooms and cafeterias."},{"name":"Small and Mid-Size Office Suites","detail":"Cost-effective cleaning programs for 1,000-10,000 sq ft office suites including professional firms (law, accounting, consulting), insurance agencies, and small business offices."},{"name":"Coworking and Flex Spaces","detail":"High-touch cleaning for shared workspace environments including hot-desk sanitization, community kitchen management, phone booth turnover, and member-facing facility presentation."},{"name":"Medical and Professional Office Buildings","detail":"Mixed-use buildings containing both standard offices and professional practices, requiring different cleaning protocols for different tenants within the same building."},{"name":"Tech and Creative Office Spaces","detail":"Open-plan office cleaning with attention to collaborative spaces, gaming and recreation areas, coffee bars, and the casual-but-clean aesthetic that technology and creative companies expect."}]},{"label":"Key Benefits","heading":"Key Benefits of Professional Office Cleaning","body":"Benefits of professional office cleaning for commercial facilities in Brooklyn include:","features":["Consistent cleaning quality across every floor and area, verified through JaniTrack photo documentation and ATP testing — eliminating the inconsistency that drives tenant complaints","Conference rooms that are meeting-ready every morning — clean tables, empty trash, stocked supplies, and clean whiteboards without any action required from your team","Restroom quality that eliminates the number one source of tenant and visitor complaints in commercial office buildings","Green Seal certified products that maintain indoor air quality — supporting LEED certification credits and protecting employee health in enclosed office environments","Flexible after-hours, overnight, and weekend scheduling that never disrupts business operations, with day porter options for daytime common area maintenance","Single-vendor accountability for janitorial, floor care, and maintenance — one point of contact, one invoice, and zero coordination between multiple contractors"]},{"label":"FAQ","heading":"Office Cleaning FAQ — Brooklyn, NY","body":"Common questions about office cleaning services in Brooklyn.","faqs":[{"q":"What is professional office cleaning?","a":"Professional office cleaning is the recurring janitorial maintenance of commercial office environments. It encompasses daily operations including trash removal, restroom sanitization, floor care (vacuuming and mopping), high-touch surface disinfection, kitchen and breakroom cleaning, lobby presentation, and conference room ready-service. Professional office cleaning differs from residential cleaning in its scale, equipment, product specifications, and the need for consistent quality across large, multi-area environments."},{"q":"Can you clean our office without disrupting business hours?","a":"Yes. We offer after-hours (evening), overnight, and weekend cleaning schedules that complete all work before your team arrives in the morning. For daytime needs, day porter services handle restroom monitoring, lobby maintenance, spill response, and conference room turnovers without disrupting your team's work. Scheduling is fully customizable to match your office's operating hours and occupancy patterns."},{"q":"How do you ensure consistent quality across multiple floors?","a":"Every floor receives a customized cleaning checklist specifying tasks, frequencies, and quality standards. Our JaniTrack system provides timestamped photo verification of completed work across every area. Supervisors conduct periodic quality audits using ISSA appearance level scoring. If quality varies between floors, we identify the root cause (staffing, training, equipment) and correct it — the data tells us exactly where to focus."},{"q":"Do you provide restroom and kitchen supplies?","a":"Yes. Supply management is included in our service — we monitor paper towel, toilet paper, soap, and hand sanitizer levels, restock during every service visit, and manage vendor relationships for consumable procurement. You never need to worry about empty dispensers or last-minute supply runs. Supply costs can be included in the contract or billed separately at your preference."},{"q":"What does office cleaning include?","a":"Our standard office cleaning includes trash removal and recycling, restroom cleaning and sanitization, floor vacuuming and mopping, high-touch surface disinfection (handles, switches, shared equipment), kitchen and breakroom cleaning, lobby and reception maintenance, conference room ready-service, and supply replenishment. Specialty services like floor stripping, carpet extraction, and window cleaning are available on periodic schedules."},{"q":"How much does office cleaning cost?","a":"Standard office cleaning ranges from $0.05-$0.15 per square foot per cleaning visit depending on square footage, cleaning frequency, restroom count, and scope. A typical 10,000 sq ft office cleaned 5 nights per week runs approximately $2,500-$5,000 per month. Multi-floor buildings and buildings with high restroom density or food service areas cost more per square foot. We provide exact pricing after a complimentary facility walkthrough."},{"q":"What is the difference between office cleaning and janitorial service?","a":"The terms are often used interchangeably. 'Janitorial service' is the broader category encompassing all recurring commercial cleaning. 'Office cleaning' specifically refers to janitorial service for office environments. The distinction matters when comparing to specialized cleaning types like medical office cleaning (which adds OSHA compliance) or school cleaning (which adds CDC protocols and non-toxic product requirements). Standard office cleaning follows ISSA appearance level standards and OSHA general housekeeping requirements."}]},{"label":"Why GreenPoint","heading":"Why Brooklyn Facilities Trust GreenPoint for Office Cleaning","body":"GreenPoint Maintenance Services is an MBE/MWBE-certified, NYC DOE Approved Vendor serving over 500 commercial facilities across New York and four additional states. Our JaniTrack verification system provides the objective, documented proof of cleaning quality that facility managers, health inspectors, and building occupants demand.","stats":[{"number":"98%","label":"Client Retention"},{"number":"500+","label":"Facilities Served"},{"number":"5","label":"States Covered"},{"number":"MBE","label":"Certified"}]}],"relatedLinks":[{"href":"/locations/new-york/brooklyn/school-cleaning/","label":"School Cleaning in Brooklyn","icon":"school"},{"href":"/locations/new-york/brooklyn/church-cleaning/","label":"Church Cleaning in Brooklyn","icon":"church"},{"href":"/locations/new-york/brooklyn/medical-office-cleaning/","label":"Medical Office Cleaning in Brooklyn","icon":"medical"},{"href":"/locations/new-york/brooklyn/daycare-cleaning/","label":"Daycare Cleaning in Brooklyn","icon":"baby"},{"href":"/locations/new-york/brooklyn/government-building-cleaning/","label":"Government Cleaning in Brooklyn","icon":"landmark"},{"href":"/locations/new-york/bronx/office-cleaning/","label":"Office Cleaning in Bronx","icon":"building"},{"href":"/locations/new-york/manhattan/office-cleaning/","label":"Office Cleaning in Manhattan","icon":"building"},{"href":"/locations/new-york/queens/office-cleaning/","label":"Office Cleaning in Queens","icon":"building"},{"href":"/locations/new-york/staten-island/office-cleaning/","label":"Office Cleaning in Staten Island","icon":"building"},{"href":"/locations/new-york/yonkers/office-cleaning/","label":"Office Cleaning in Yonkers","icon":"building"}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","locations","children","$6","children","$7","children","$8","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L9",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","locations","children","$6","children","$7","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L9",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","locations","children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L9",null,{}],"templateStyles":